<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ country.name }} — Macro Dashboard</title>
<script src="https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.32.0.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #f4efe7;
    --paper-deep: #ece3d6;
    --ink: #171310;
    --muted: #63574e;
    --accent: #8a593d;
    --accent-soft: rgba(138, 89, 61, 0.12);
    --line: rgba(23, 19, 16, 0.14);
    --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.36);
    --font-display: "Iowan Old Style", "Songti SC", "Noto Serif SC", "Palatino Linotype", "Book Antiqua", Georgia, serif;
    --font-body: "Avenir Next", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Noto Sans SC", "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 320px;
    padding: 0 24px 32px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(138, 89, 61, 0.14), transparent 24%),
      radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(54, 75, 97, 0.12), transparent 22%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f8f4ed 0%, #f4efe7 48%, #efe7db 100%);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(23, 19, 16, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(23, 19, 16, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45), transparent 85%);
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .container {
    position: relative;
    width: min(1240px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  header {
    min-height: 44vh;
    display: grid;
    align-content: end;
    padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 112px) 0 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  header .eyebrow {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  header h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(46px, 8vw, 92px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0.94;
  }
  header .meta {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 18px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    background: rgba(244, 239, 231, 0.84);
  }
  .toc a {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 180ms ease;
  }
  .toc a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  section.panel {
    padding: clamp(44px, 7vw, 72px) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  section.panel h2 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  section.panel .blurb {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  .snapshot {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .tile {
    min-height: 96px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--panel);
  }
  .tile .k {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .tile .v {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .snapshot-group { margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .snapshot-subtitle {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .charts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(520px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .chart-cell {
    min-height: 430px;
    height: 430px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .chart-cell .plotly-graph-div { height: 100% !important; }
  .commentary {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 16px 0 0 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  .commentary strong { color: var(--accent); }
  footer {
    padding: 28px 0 48px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .context-grid,
  .trade-grid,
  .cb-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(360px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .context-card,
  .trade-card,
  .cb-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
  }
  .context-card-header,
  .trade-card-header,
  .cb-card-header {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .context-card-body,
  .trade-card-body,
  .cb-card-body {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }
  .trade-card-body table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .trade-card-body th {
    padding: 5px 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-align: left;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .trade-card-body td {
    padding: 5px 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 19, 16, 0.08);
  }
  .cb-card-body ul {
    margin: 6px 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }
  .cb-card-body li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .cb-card-body p { margin: 0 0 9px; }
  strong { color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    body { padding: 0 14px 24px; }
    header { min-height: 34vh; }
    .toc {
      position: static;
      padding: 12px 0;
    }
    .tile { border-right: 0; }
    .chart-cell {
      min-height: 390px;
      height: 390px;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

<header>
  <div class="eyebrow">Country Primer / Macro Dashboard</div>
  <h1>{{ country.name }} — Macro Dashboard</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    Generated {{ generated_at }} · Peers: {{ peers|join(", ") }} ·
    Framework: IMF FPP × Goldman Sachs Indicators × Buy-side PM lens
  </div>
</header>

<div class="toc">
  {% for s in sections %}<a href="#{{ s.id }}">{{ s.title }}</a>{% endfor %}
</div>

{# §1 Snapshot #}
<section class="panel" id="snapshot">
  <h2>{{ snapshot_title }}</h2>
  <div class="blurb">{{ snapshot_blurb }}</div>
  {% for group in snapshot_tiles %}
  <div class="snapshot-group">
    <h3 class="snapshot-subtitle">{{ group.subtitle }}</h3>
    <div class="snapshot">
      {% for k, v in group.tiles %}
      <div class="tile"><div class="k">{{ k }}</div><div class="v">{{ v }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if geo_context or political_context or societal_context %}
  <div class="context-grid">
    {% if geo_context %}
    <div class="context-card">
      <div class="context-card-header">Geography &amp; Infrastructure</div>
      <div class="context-card-body">{{ geo_context }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if political_context %}
    <div class="context-card">
      <div class="context-card-header">Political Economy</div>
      <div class="context-card-body">{{ political_context }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if societal_context %}
    <div class="context-card">
      <div class="context-card-header">Society &amp; Demographics</div>
      <div class="context-card-body">{{ societal_context }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{# Trade section (if available) #}
{% if trade_section %}
<section class="panel" id="trade">
  <h2>{{ trade_section.title }}</h2>
  <div class="blurb">{{ trade_section.blurb }}</div>
  {% if trade_section.charts %}
  <div class="charts">{{ trade_section.charts|safe }}</div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if trade_section.summary %}
  {{ trade_section.summary|safe }}
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{# Central Bank section #}
{% if cb_section %}
<section class="panel" id="central_bank">
  <h2>Central Bank Monitor</h2>
  <div class="blurb">Institutional structure, personnel, balance sheet, and policy framework — the lens through which rate decisions and market operations should be interpreted.</div>

  <div class="cb-grid">
    <div class="cb-card">
      <div class="cb-card-header">Leadership &amp; Decision-Making</div>
      <div class="cb-card-body">
        <p><strong>Governor:</strong> {{ cb_section.governor }}</p>
        <p><strong>Board:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          {% for member in cb_section.board %}
          <li>{{ member }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p><strong>MPC:</strong> {{ cb_section.mpc }}</p>
        <p><strong>Meetings:</strong> {{ cb_section.meeting_schedule }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cb-card">
      <div class="cb-card-header">Policy Framework</div>
      <div class="cb-card-body">{{ cb_section.policy_framework }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cb-card">
      <div class="cb-card-header">Balance Sheet</div>
      <div class="cb-card-body">
        <p><strong>Total Assets:</strong> {{ cb_section.balance_sheet.total_assets }}</p>
        <ul>
          {% for item in cb_section.balance_sheet.key_items %}
          <li>{{ item }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cb-card">
      <div class="cb-card-header">Key Risks &amp; Vulnerabilities</div>
      <div class="cb-card-body">{{ cb_section.key_risks }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{# §2-§7 chart sections #}
{% for s in sections %}
<section class="panel" id="{{ s.id }}">
  <h2>{{ s.title }}</h2>
  <div class="charts">
    {% for fig_html in s.charts %}
    <div class="chart-cell">{{ fig_html|safe }}</div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if s.commentary %}
  <div class="commentary">{{ s.commentary|safe }}</div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% endfor %}

<footer>
  Country Primer v{{ version }} · Data via openecon-data MCP, ECB, World Bank ·
  This is a research artefact, not investment advice.
</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
